WEBVTT

00:07:57.210 --> 00:08:00.210
and this is only the beginning.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.220
Thank you.

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:07.110
(Applause)

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:12.020
BMA has supported charities and volunteers

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:15.040
who have helped reshape Lebanon,

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.160
raising funds for their causes

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:20.060
and encouraging others to give.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:25.100
The culture of giving and doing good
has become contagious.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.110
Stereotypes have been broken.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:32.000
Change-makers and future leaders
have been created.